		'If an audit fits, we book 30 minutes' =>
			'Jika audit sesuai, kami tempah 30 minit',
		'No commitment and no charge. We look at what you have, say what we would fix first, and tell you plainly if we are not the right people for it.' =>
			'Tanpa komitmen dan tanpa bayaran. Kami melihat apa yang anda ada, menyatakan apa yang akan kami baiki dahulu, dan memberitahu anda dengan jelas jika kami bukan orang yang sesuai untuknya.',
		'Nothing was added to a mailing list. Your details are used to reply to you and nothing else, as set out in our' =>
